 "name_en": "Supplier Classification and Segmentation (19E)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Supplier Classification and Segmentation (19E)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio0e189aef658d4eff93cfa080bc9f4341\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0e189aef658d4eff93cfa080bc9f4341__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item helps you gain a portfolio-level view of your supplier relationships. It also gives you the transparency to continuously determine the right mix of suppliers, serve your business objectives optimally, and to reduce your overall supply risk. You can classify and segment your suppliers by multiple criteria. This enables you to identify suppliers in a flexible manner, as well as to define and monitor sourcing strategies.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0e189aef658d4eff93cfa080bc9f4341__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create classification scorecard for supplier</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create purchasing categories</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Search suppliers via assigned attributes</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0e189aef658d4eff93cfa080bc9f4341__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create a strategic approach to supplier management</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Maximize value and minimizes supply-based risk</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Support powerful searches using all strategic attributes as parameters</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Enable multiple classifications per supplier using flexible dimensions (for example factory, category, region)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Provide analysis needed to identify valuable suppliers</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>供应商分类和细分 (19E)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio0e189aef658d4eff93cfa080bc9f4341\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0e189aef658d4eff93cfa080bc9f4341__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目可帮助您获得供应商关系的产品组合级别视图。此外，您还可以提高透明度，持续确定合适的供应商组合，以最佳方式满足您的业务目标，并降低整体供应风险。您可以按多个条件对供应商进行分类和细分。这使您能够以灵活的方式识别供应商，以及定义和监控寻源策略。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0e189aef658d4eff93cfa080bc9f4341__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">为供应商创建分类计分卡</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建采购类别</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过分配的属性搜索供应商</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0e189aef658d4eff93cfa080bc9f4341__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建供应商管理的战略方法</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">实现价值最大化，尽可能地降低基于供应的风险</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">支持所有战略属性作为参数进行强大的搜索</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用灵活的维度（例如工厂、类别、地区）为每个供应商启用多个分类</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提供识别有价值供应商所需的分析</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
